// spec: 4
// An unclosed `(` around a point, a lone `.x` axis in parentheses, an offset after a grouped point, and a point in two sets of parentheses, are parse errors.
diagram "grouped errors" size (300,200)
box a at (40,20) size (80,40)
box b at (a.center+(0,80) size (20,20)
box c at (a.center)+(0,4) size (20,20)
box d at (a.left.x) size (20,20)
line l (a.bottom -> b.top
box e at ((a.center)) size (20,20)
junction f at ((a.left.x, a.top.y))
text "t" at (( 10,20 ))
